+## Verdict and next direction
+
+C4 now has a concrete process-memory owner for one immutable device/backend
+snapshot, with exact identity, replay, secret, capacity, and restart behavior.
+It does not yet resolve or execute that context, so it must not be advertised
+as Archive Center server-host support.
+
+That next C4/H2 slice is now implemented and validated in
+`docs/pocketrisu-host-context-h2-validation.md`. PocketRisu caller wiring,
+actual payload-application parity, capability activation, and later C6
+lifecycle/effect-lineage gates remain outside this historical checkpoint.
