+# PocketRisu host context H2 validation
+
+Date: 2026-09-20
+
+Status: **local source implementation and automatic validation complete;
+PocketRisu capability remains disabled and no live runtime was changed**
+
+Implementation commits:
+
+- `fbe5162a4e5884897b146adaa7179b3f8fb61207` — strict authenticated host
+  transport, durable lifecycle join, context release/tombstones, and startup
+  running-prepare reconciliation;
+- `6968ac6044bf9fde059d2532a28f37bf00fe9912` — captured-only production
+  consumers, prompt snapshots, server-host prepare/complete observations,
+  typed prepared payload identity, restart response recovery, and private-value
+  output fences.
+
+Implementation tree: `142bcc3a34cab369393b7199d8bd6a6a706aa422`
