+## 5. Cross-piece interaction check
+
+- **Transport + store + memory:** capture validates the active claim, recovers
+  an existing durable key before allocating, registers one context, and
+  discards newly allocated bytes on registration failure.
+- **Restart + provider safety:** readiness changes running to unknown; registered
+  or ready rows with missing context can be inspected and terminated but cannot
+  reach a model caller.
+- **Prepare + main:** typed prepared payload binds the exact context and
+  assembled payload hash; H3 still must prove that PocketRisu applies those
+  bytes to the actual main request.
+- **Complete + release:** v4 accepts only a canonical server commit bound to the
+  same operation; exact cached complete response survives later context release
+  inside the process.
+- **Prompt + error output:** full prompt bytes stay in captured material/provider
