+or a lost settle response is replayed after the slot has moved to another
+owner. Migration 014 uses a canonical-session primary key, a unique active
+host/operation key, immutable unique host/operation and host/end-event outcome
+keys, and a monotonically retained claim epoch. The requested and final end
+reasons are distinct fields.
